  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>마<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>웨<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/A83IJhXR7sY?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>細漢<rt>쇠ˋ한</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>時陣<rt>시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>阿媽<rt>아ˉ마ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>對<rt>뒤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>上好<rt>셩호ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ti-soè-han’e si-jūn gûn-ā-mà tùi-goà siong-hò\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    가<ruby>上好<rt>셩호ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>物件<rt>밓걀ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>留<rt>ᄅᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허ˉ</rt></ruby>’꽈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ka-siong-hò’e mih-kiā̰ lông-e-lau-hōr’goa\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans TC\">\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>定定<rt>댤댤-</rt></ruby><ruby>𤆬<rt>촤-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>去<rt>킈ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>유<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>치<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>엔<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ī ma-tia̰-tia̰-choa-goà khì-yū-chî-èn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𨑨<rt>칟ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>迌<rt>토ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-láng lêh-chît-thó\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>辦公伙<rt>반겅ˉ훼ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>覕相揣<rt>삫ˆ쇼ˉ췌ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-láng lêh-pan-kōng-huê-à khoà̰-láng lêh-bîh-siō-chuē\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>定定<rt>댤댤-</rt></ruby><ruby>共<rt>가-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ī tia̰-tia̰-ka-gûn-kòng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>叫<rt>교ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>好好<rt>호ˆ호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>讀冊<rt>탁쳏</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kiò-gùn tio-ài-hô-hô-â-thak-cheh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>通<rt>탕ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>大漢<rt>돠한</rt></ruby> <ruby>像<rt>츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>린<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>老爸<rt>ᄅᅷ베-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>遐邇<rt>햫ˆ니-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>狼狽<rt>령붸ˉ</rt></ruby>’엏\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-thāng-toa-han chiṵ-lîn-lau-pe-à hiâh-ni-â-liong-puē’orh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>个<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>時陣<rt>시준ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>聽<rt>턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ti-hît-e-si-jūn gùn lông-thiā̰-lông-bó\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>阿媽<rt>아ˉ마ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā-mà\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>到底<rt>ᄃᅷˋ되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥貨<rt>샬ˆ훼</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì tàu-toè si-lêh-kông-siâ̰-hue\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>大漢<rt>돠한</rt></ruby> <ruby>了後<rt>ᄅᆤˆᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>才<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>阿媽<rt>아ˉ마ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>話<rt>웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    toa-han liâu-āu jiâh-jāi-yà̰ ā-mà’e wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby>가<ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>囥<rt>킁ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>心肝<rt>심ˉ괄ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>底<rt>되ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà e-ka-yêng-oàn yêng-oàn khǹg-lêh-sīm-koā̰-toè\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>一幕<rt>짇뻐-</rt></ruby><ruby>一幕<rt>짇뻐ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>過去<rt>궤ˋ킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-tioh-jit-bor-jit-bōr’e kuè-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>定定<rt>댤댤-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>真<rt>진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>難忘<rt>란뻥ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tia̰-tia̰-lông-e-hor-láng jīn-lan-bōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>時間<rt>시간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一分<rt>짇훈ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一秒<rt>짇뾰ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤</rt></ruby>’킈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-kân jit-hûn jit-biò lêh-kue’khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ti-gùn’e sīm-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>定定<rt>댤댤-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’둏이\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tia̰-tia̰-lông-e-siṵ̄’tioh-i\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>阿媽<rt>아ˉ마ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>馬<rt>마ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>底位<rt>도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā-mà lì jît-mà ti-tô-wī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>叫<rt>교</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>聽<rt>턀ˆ</rt></ruby>’둏\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn lêh-kio’li lì kâm-u-thiâ̰’tioh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>認真<rt>띤진ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>成功<rt>솅겅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn’e rin-jîn kâh-gùn’e sieng-kông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby>’둏\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kâm-u-khoa̰’tioh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>叫<rt>교</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby>’뽀\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn lêh-kio’li lì jāi-yà̰’bo\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>阿媽<rt>아ˉ마ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>馬<rt>마ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>호ˋ</rt></ruby>’뽀\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā-mà lì jît-mà kuè-tioh-hò’bo\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby>가<ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>照顧<rt>ᄌᆤˋ거</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâm-u-láng lêh-ka-lì jiàu-kor\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>希望<rt>히ˉ빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>後世人<rt>ᄋᅷ시ˋ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>會當<rt>에당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>疼<rt>턀</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hī-bang-au-sì-láng gùn kôh-e-tàng-lai-hor-lî-thia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>做<rt>조ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>孫<rt>순ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jò-lì yêng-oàn’e sūn-à\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>叫<rt>교ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一聲<rt>짇샬ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>阿媽<rt>아ˉ마ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kôh-kiò-lì jit-siā̰-ā-mà\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>一幕<rt>짇뻐-</rt></ruby><ruby>一幕<rt>짇뻐ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>過去<rt>궤ˋ킈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-tioh-jit-bor-jit-bōr’e kuè-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>定定<rt>댤댤-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>真<rt>진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>難忘<rt>란뻥ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tia̰-tia̰-lông-e-hor-láng jīn-lan-bōng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>時間<rt>시간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一分<rt>짇훈ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一秒<rt>짇뾰ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>過<rt>궤</rt></ruby>’킈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-kân jit-hûn jit-biò lêh-kue’khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ti-gùn’e sīm-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>定定<rt>댤댤-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’둏이\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tia̰-tia̰-lông-e-siṵ̄’tioh-i\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>阿媽<rt>아ˉ마ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>馬<rt>마ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>底位<rt>도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā-mà lì jît-mà ti-tô-wī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>叫<rt>교</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>聽<rt>턀ˆ</rt></ruby>’둏\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn lêh-kio’li lì kâm-u-thiâ̰’tioh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>認真<rt>띤진ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>成功<rt>솅겅ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn’e rin-jîn kâh-gùn’e sieng-kông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby>’둏\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kâm-u-khoa̰’tioh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>叫<rt>교</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby>’뽀\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    gùn lêh-kio’li lì jāi-yà̰’bo\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>阿媽<rt>아ˉ마ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>馬<rt>마ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>過<rt>궤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>호ˋ</rt></ruby>’뽀\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā-mà lì jît-mà kuè-tioh-hò’bo\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby>가<ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>照顧<rt>ᄌᆤˋ거</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâm-u-láng lêh-ka-lì jiàu-kor\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>希望<rt>히ˉ빵-</rt></ruby><ruby>後世人<rt>ᄋᅷ시ˋ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>會當<rt>에당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>予<rt>허-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>疼<rt>턀</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hī-bang-au-sì-láng gùn kôh-e-tàng-lai-hor-lî-thia̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>做<rt>조ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>永遠<rt>옝ˆ완ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>孫<rt>순ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jò-lì yêng-oàn’e sūn-à\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>叫<rt>교ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一聲<rt>짇샬ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>阿媽<rt>아ˉ마ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kôh-kiò-lì jit-siā̰-ā-mà\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n\n\n\n<table class=\"wp-block-table alignleft\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;border: none;font-size: 14px\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"border: none;vertical-align: top;min-width: 5em;padding-right: 1.5em;padding-left: 0;padding-top: 0;padding-bottom: 0\">\n  <a href=\"#_ftnref1\" id=\"_ftn1\">¹</a>\n  <i>\n    <span style=\"display: inline-flex\">\n      <ruby>유<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>치<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>엔<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>\n    </span>\n  </i> :\n</td>\n    <td style=\"border: none;padding: 0\">\n      (中) 幼稚園（日文：<ruby>幼稚園<rt>ようちえん</rt></ruby> yōchien）。<br>\n      (en) Kindergarten (Japanese: <ruby>幼稚園<rt>ようちえん</rt></ruby> yōchien).\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;margin-bottom: 1em\"></div>\n"
